Skye UI — source attribution
============================

The screens in skye/ui/web adapt components from these Apache-2.0 sources, at
the request of the Skye repository owner, preserving their design and
interaction patterns:

block/buzz @ acf56fff6fbfece9f143de3f096cb1d258fb9a9f
  https://github.com/block/buzz
  - desktop/src/features/workflows/ui/WorkflowRunTrace.tsx
    -> web/src/components/AgentPanel.tsx and TaskCanvas.tsx (per-step status
       marks, monospace step ids, output blocks; originally MissionRunTrace.tsx)
  - desktop/src/features/workflows/ui/WorkflowApprovalCard.tsx
    -> web/src/components/ApprovalCard.tsx (buzz's card is read-only; Skye's
       is functional: it records the one-time, fingerprint-bound approval)
  - desktop/src/shared/ui/badge.tsx (shadcn/ui Badge)
    -> web/src/components/ui/Badge.tsx (variant map inlined; no cva dependency)

block/berd @ 2d2754640abbb5a7f26fe190551a7173f5c87788
  https://github.com/block/berd
  - src/features/automations/ui/AutomationsOverview.tsx and
    AutomationOverviewRow.tsx
    -> web/src/components/MissionsOverview.tsx (card rows, status activity
       dot, title + summary, last-activity label)

Both projects are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Their licenses permit this
adaptation with attribution; their NOTICE requirements are satisfied by this
file. The adaptations are substantial rewrites for Skye's domain (missions,
journals, one-time approvals) and carry per-file attribution headers naming
their source.

Additional berd sources adapted in the visual-fidelity pass:

block/berd @ 2d2754640abbb5a7f26fe190551a7173f5c87788 (Apache-2.0)
  - src/shared/styles/globals.css (semantic color tokens, gray scale,
    canvas/composer surfaces, 5-step radius scale)
    -> web/src/index.css
  - src/features/home/ui/HomeScreen.tsx (clock + greeting + centered composer)
    and the chat-composer token recipe (translucent muted surface, 40px radius,
    backdrop blur)
    -> web/src/components/HomeView.tsx
  - src/app/assets/fonts/Inter[opsz,wght].ttf, Inter-Italic[opsz,wght].ttf,
    GeistMono[wght].ttf -> web/src/assets/fonts/ (verbatim copies).
    The fonts are NOT Apache-2.0: Inter and Geist Mono are SIL Open Font
